\to((s_1=s_2)\\to(t_1=t_2)))\n\\mid s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"S,+,\\cdot,=","display":false}],"bytes":3127,"backlinks":[{"id":"71cba92f19dac4d2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axiom set, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])"},{"id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a433d8f87b4f42f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axiom set, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])"},{"id":"a9f2cffd9da7a09c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"L5 的 side condition 按原书采用“不出现”。L6 的存在量词必须展开为 $\\neg_E\\forall v\\neg_E(v=t)$。本组是原书七个模式；本地 G 的另一套逻辑公理见 [[92-df-logical-axiom]]。"},{"id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82fce7dbd28f0125","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f29ba4fd68c3479","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f700bea2b74485f2","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"553707b7a7425e75","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29a0403e0c65ae9d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axioms, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地 PA 支线由[[92-df-g-system]]、[[92-df-logical-axiom]]、[[92-df-godel-numbering]]、[[92-df-proof-predicate]]给出。[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]解释为什么这里需要 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$，不能误写所有七条 $Q$ 公理均为该 PA 呈现的原始公理。"},{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_G$ (logical axioms, see [[92-df-logical-axiom]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","b2016a44e2de38ce","725c1f1651ce9a00","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","4ef6f65f207e8439","d666a3e3ee6c8148"]}